"stop - do not reboot and the Agama backend continues running.\n"
"\n"
"reboot - reboot into the installed system. This value is the default. It can "
"be overriden by setting the inst.finish kernel command-line argument.\n"
"\n"
"halt - halt the installed machine.\n"
"\n"
"poweroff - power off the installed machine."
msgstr ""

